Package: aquamusic
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: AquaMusic <local@aquamusic.app>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-tk
Recommends: python3-pip, python3-flask, python3-mutagen, python3-pil, python3-requests, yt-dlp
Description: AquaMusic lightweight local server & music player
 Lightweight XAMPP-style local music server and control panel with browser player,
 synchronized lyrics, living aurora themes, and LAN/mobile sharing.
